  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Chapter 334 opens by naming Eastern Sea, Western Desert, Northern Plains, Southern Border, and Central Continent, then shows Immortal Crane Sect on Fei He mountain. Fang Zheng fights Sun Yuan Hua in the eight year middle examination, takes first place, and becomes an elite disciple of Immortal Crane Sect.",
      "chapters": [
        334
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "reg_western_desert",
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "reg_southern_border",
        "reg_central_continent",
        "fac_immortal_crane_sect",
        "loc_fei_he_mountain",
        "char_fang_zheng",
        "char_sun_yuan_hua"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan reminded Shang Xin Ci of the seats above the ten young masters: young clan leader Shang Tuo Hai, the five elders, her father Shang Yan Fei, and even the supreme elder of Shang clan.",
      "chapters": [
        333
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_shang_xin_ci",
        "char_shang_tuo_hai",
        "char_shang_yan_fei",
        "fac_shang_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan and Bai Ning Bing stand on Huo Tan mountain among lava crocodile corpses after killing the thousand beast king, then resume their journey.",
      "chapters": [
        336
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "huo-tan-mountain",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_bai_ning_bing",
        "loc_huo_tan_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A rank three demonic Gu Master, old monster Hei Shi, blocks them. Fang Yuan’s beast phantom kills him once breath concealment Gu drops and his rank four aura shows. Watchers name the pair the black and white twin demons, geniuses of the demonic path from Shang clan city’s battle stage, with Fang Zheng called little beast king. Fang Yuan treats killing for notoriety as a tool: kill until people tremble, so they will not lightly provoke them. Their vicious reputation spreads toward San Cha mountain before they arrive. Several months have passed since the three kings inheritance appeared there, causing a huge disturbance in Southern Border, and the mountain has become a slaughterhouse for righteous and demonic quotas.",
      "chapters": [
        337
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "road-to-san-cha",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_demonic_path",
        "gu_breath_concealment_gu",
        "loc_shang_clan_city",
        "loc_san_cha_mountain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "On San Cha mountain Fang Yuan says what he treads on is the demonic path, and that here individual strength can sit above a group.",
      "chapters": [
        344
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "demonic-path-stance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Chapter 364 is titled Soaring Reputation. The crowd says little beast king fought against seven and won, that present age overlord lost his life, and that he is this generation’s number one star of the demonic path. Bai Ning Bing, freed from days of being trapped, sees that his cultivation has advanced to middle stage and that his flying control now makes him a flying expert in Southern Border.",
      "chapters": [
        364
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "soaring-reputation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
